@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #374151
  LifeLineBorderColor #6B7280
  ParticipantBorderColor #4B5563
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  ParticipantFontColor #111827
}

actor Employee
participant "React Accommodation Lego" as Lego
participant "Accommodation BFF" as BFF
participant "Policy & Workflow" as Domain
participant "Booking.com Adapter" as Adapter
participant "Booking.com Demand API" as Booking

Employee -> Lego: Select office, dates and occupancy
Lego -> BFF: Search accommodation
BFF -> Domain: Resolve policy and entitlement
Domain -> Adapter: Search with policy-aware criteria
Adapter -> Booking: accommodations/search
Booking --> Adapter: Candidate properties and products
Adapter --> Domain: Normalised proposals
Domain --> BFF: Proposals with policy explanations
BFF --> Lego: Display list, filters and map
Employee -> Lego: Select proposal and submit request
Lego -> BFF: Create booking request
BFF -> Domain: Persist request, offer and policy snapshots

== Operator-controlled booking ==

Domain -> Adapter: Recheck availability
Adapter -> Booking: accommodations/availability
Booking --> Adapter: Current product and price
Domain -> Adapter: Preview order
Adapter -> Booking: orders/preview
Booking --> Adapter: Final price, policies and order token
Domain -> Domain: Re-evaluate policy and approval
Domain -> Adapter: Create order (idempotent workflow)
Adapter -> Booking: orders/create
Booking --> Adapter: Confirmed order reference
Adapter --> Domain: Booking confirmation
Domain --> BFF: BOOKED
BFF --> Lego: Confirmation and status
@enduml
